						"props": {
							"markdown": "## Slots in this example\n\n**Root**\n- `appready` — hide doors (same as the first tab), then camera path around the model\n- `computationstart` — show *Computation started*\n- `computationend` — show *Computation finished*\n- `exportstart` — show *Export started*\n- `exportend` — show *Export finished*\n\n**Left tabs**\n- first tab `click` — hide doors\n- second tab `click` — show doors\n- text widget `pointerenter` / `pointerleave` — set **Material Color** while hovering, reset when the pointer leaves\n\nSelecting a tab does not emit `click` on load, so `appready` also hides the doors. Change **Length** to trigger computation. Use **Obj Export** to trigger export slots. Hover the text under a tab to change color (that also starts a computation)."
						}
